# Six and Seven Island (FireRed's MUS_SEVII_67, which the last two islands share): a wistful tune in E minor, an oboe
# over a celesta's slow broken chords, a string pad and a deep bass, for the far islands of ruins and canyons where
# few people live. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K9, part b).
